--- !u!114 &387075153
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 387075152}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 573f2d3315aca1244816ff1c1a65a43d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CustomerSpawner
  customerPrefab: {fileID: 5216331132947492705, guid: 6bf9f6df65489e244bb35fca19f3f2f1, type: 3}
  counterQueue: {fileID: 2048013196}
  exitPoint: {fileID: 387075154}
  spawnEvery: 10
  maxCustomers: 3
  archetypes:
  - archetypeName: Cheerful
    lines:
    - Hiiiiii! Goooooood morning, the weather outside is so nice!
    - Oh my God! I love what you've done with this place.
    - 'This spot was on TikTok, so I had to come! '
    - You're the BEST!
    patienceMultiplier: 1.2
    tipMultiplier: 1.2
    moodColor: {r: 0.9019608, g: 0.65882355, b: 0.09019608, a: 1}
  - archetypeName: Sad
    lines:
    - My cat died last night. I just needed to get out the house.
    - My dad died and this was all i had to remember him by.
    - I'm scared, it's my moms, and she'll kill me if she knows i messed it up!
    patienceMultiplier: 1.4
    tipMultiplier: 1.5
    moodColor: {r: 0.37254903, g: 0.49411765, b: 0.61960787, a: 1}
  - archetypeName: Hungry
    lines:
    - Please tell me you sell food here too? I am starving!
    - Something inside here smells freaking amazing!
    patienceMultiplier: 0.9
    tipMultiplier: 1
    moodColor: {r: 0.8235294, g: 0.4392157, b: 0.22745098, a: 1}
  - archetypeName: Impatient
    lines:
    - I'm on my lunch break here, and it's taking forever.
    - What in God's name is taking so long?
    - Look, are you going to fix this? Or not?
    - I'm just going to go somewhere else.
    patienceMultiplier: 0.6
    tipMultiplier: 0.8
    moodColor: {r: 0.81960785, g: 0.2627451, b: 0.2627451, a: 1}
  - archetypeName: Chatty
    lines:
    - 'My neighbor''s been parking on my side of the driveway for the past week,
      and it''s been driving me insane! Either he moves it or I will get him towed! '
    - Have you been living in the city for long? I just moved a week ago, and I'm
      trying to meet new people from the city, they all tell me to come here!
    - 'What the hell is going on? I think I got hacked, something''s not right with
      my computer. I know the Government is watching and they are DEFINITELY the
      ones who are hacking into my stuff. '
    patienceMultiplier: 1.4
    tipMultiplier: 1
    moodColor: {r: 0.54509807, g: 0.41960785, b: 0.69411767, a: 1}
